<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's SFE wheat futures move higher.</title>
<headline>Australia's SFE wheat futures move higher.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Traded Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat futures moved higher on Friday with the November contract climbing A$3.50 to A$184.50 a tonne on a volume of only two lots while the January contract gained A$3.50 per tonne on a volume of just four lots.</p>
<p>Settlement prices for the untraded contracts were higher.</p>
